<title>USA: Empire District elects McKinney president.</title>
<headline>Empire District elects McKinney president.</headline>
<dateline>JOPLIN, Mo. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire District Electric Co said on Thursday its board elected Myron McKinney to the position of president and chief executive officer, effective April 1, 1997. McKinney will succeed president Robert Lamb, who is retiring.</p>
<p>McKinney has served as executive vice president-commercial operations of the power company since September 11, 1995 and as a director since 1991.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
